        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous Galaxy is a rogue-lite with physics-based combat and extensive ship upgrading, where you explore procedurally generated star systems, manage resources, and fight enemies and boss battles to save the galaxy from evil. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive ship upgrading system:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 35 unique passive and active ship upgrades with unique effects based on their tiers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable main weapons that you can choose before each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom to build the ship in a way that you want by stacking passive and active upgrades, as long as they connect to the core of the ship. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each upgrade can be leveled up, and active upgrades present a unique choice of what power to add to the upgrade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player can hold up to 4 active abilities at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842490/extras/f1bc65480a7461e0bb96be030358cefd.poster.avif?t=1786595348\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842490/extras/f1bc65480a7461e0bb96be030358cefd.webm?t=1786595348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842490/extras/f1bc65480a7461e0bb96be030358cefd.mp4?t=1786595348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun physics-based combat:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every object (including the player) can be pushed away, bumped into, or destroyed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active abilities (like rockets) can create explosions or gravity-altering effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842490/extras/771c0fed891a989d41d0bad61a2db38c.poster.avif?t=1786595348\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842490/extras/771c0fed891a989d41d0bad61a2db38c.webm?t=1786595348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842490/extras/771c0fed891a989d41d0bad61a2db38c.mp4?t=1786595348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated star systems and levels:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is split into 4 stages. Each stage has a procedurally generated star system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star systems have many levels, and each level is procedurally generated (except the boss battles).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you travel through the star system, the danger and difficulty of it increase, as shown in the danger meter below. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover special events that allow you to choose one out of three upgrades and lost cargo containers. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842490/extras/694fd8f95a3060b9ea97cd251a7ff4d7.avif?t=1786595348\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842490/extras_big/694fd8f95a3060b9ea97cd251a7ff4d7.avif?t=1786595348 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842490/extras/73bfad2aca8a9da4e882a6b6ca380d2b.avif?t=1786595348\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842490/extras_big/73bfad2aca8a9da4e882a6b6ca380d2b.avif?t=1786595348 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Like what you see? Give the demo a try. It's free!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contact: <strong>rogue[dot]plankton[dot]games[at]gmail[dot]com</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam artwork credits: <strong>Roguelikes in Space bundle artwork created by digijelly on Artstation</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous Galaxy is a rogue-lite with physics-based combat and extensive ship upgrading, where you explore procedurally generated star systems, manage resources, and fight enemies and boss battles to save the galaxy from evil. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive ship upgrading system:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 35 unique passive and active ship upgrades with unique effects based on their tiers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable main weapons that you can choose before each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freedom to build the ship in a way that you want by stacking passive and active upgrades, as long as they connect to the core of the ship. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each upgrade can be leveled up, and active upgrades present a unique choice of what power to add to the upgrade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player can hold up to 4 active abilities at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842490/extras/f1bc65480a7461e0bb96be030358cefd.poster.avif?t=1786595348\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842490/extras/f1bc65480a7461e0bb96be030358cefd.webm?t=1786595348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842490/extras/f1bc65480a7461e0bb96be030358cefd.mp4?t=1786595348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun physics-based combat:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every object (including the player) can be pushed away, bumped into, or destroyed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active abilities (like rockets) can create explosions or gravity-altering effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842490/extras/771c0fed891a989d41d0bad61a2db38c.poster.avif?t=1786595348\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842490/extras/771c0fed891a989d41d0bad61a2db38c.webm?t=1786595348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842490/extras/771c0fed891a989d41d0bad61a2db38c.mp4?t=1786595348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated star systems and levels:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is split into 4 stages. Each stage has a procedurally generated star system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star systems have many levels, and each level is procedurally generated (except the boss battles).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you travel through the star system, the danger and difficulty of it increase, as shown in the danger meter below. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover special events that allow you to choose one out of three upgrades and lost cargo containers. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842490/extras/694fd8f95a3060b9ea97cd251a7ff4d7.avif?t=1786595348\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842490/extras_big/694fd8f95a3060b9ea97cd251a7ff4d7.avif?t=1786595348 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842490/extras/73bfad2aca8a9da4e882a6b6ca380d2b.avif?t=1786595348\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842490/extras_big/73bfad2aca8a9da4e882a6b6ca380d2b.avif?t=1786595348 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Like what you see? Give the demo a try. It's free!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contact: <strong>rogue[dot]plankton[dot]games[at]gmail[dot]com</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam artwork credits: <strong>Roguelikes in Space bundle artwork created by digijelly on Artstation</strong></p>",
